      "text": "According to the Synoptics, when Jesus is led away to be crucified, the Roman guard…find a man of Cyrene, Simon by name, and compel him to carry the cross…The fourth Gospel, however, does not appear to know anything of this incident or of Simon of Cyrene, but distinctly states that Jesus bore his own cross.",
